OL,3,GNEWSANI doctors' strike due to end,    
OL,4,Awith separate walkout planned for      
OL,5,AMonday                                 
OL,7,FA 24-hour strike by resident doctors in
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland is due to end at 07:00
OL,9,FGMT on Saturday.                       
OL,11,FBut consultants and specialist doctors 
OL,12,Fwill begin a separate 24-hour strike on
OL,13,FMonday, as part of the same pay        
OL,14,Fdispute.                               
OL,16,FThe British Medical Association (BMA)  
OL,17,Frejected a recommended 3.5% pay rise   
OL,18,Fand wants to restore the value of      
OL,19,Fdoctors' pay to 2008 levels.           
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
