OL,3,GNEWSANI doctors' strike due to end,    
OL,4,Awith separate walkout planned for      
OL,5,AMonday                                 
OL,7,FHealth Minister, Robbie Butler, said he
OL,8,Fhad accepted the recommended rise but  
OL,9,Fcould not implement it without         
OL,10,Fsufficient funding for his department. 
